  "bybit_coindays_reproducing_shipped_panel": "16 of 16",
  "note": "The delisted rows are measured on the shipped Bybit panel's publish-time book basis, not the engine stamp the order-book parser now prefers, so the contrast carries no book-time shift. Binance bookTicker has a single causal stamp and no such choice arises."
